{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56818","headline":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序） 次扶桑神王歌一章 · 项宗","name":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序） 次扶桑神王歌一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨啓太帝室，超越匏瓜水。\n碧海飞翠波，连岑赤岳峙。\n浮轮云涛际，九龙同辔起。\n虎旗欝霞津，灵风翻然而理。\n华存久乐道，遂致高神拟。\n拔徙三缘外感会乃方始。\n相期阳洛宫，道成携魏子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}